2. Edit document.
3. Template remains unchanged.
4. Edit template.
5. Existing document remains unchanged.
6. Delete template.
7. Existing document remains readable.
8. Save document.
9. Close.
10. Reopen.
11. Save As creates an independent document if implemented in this phase.

